# Per-station config: holds the RTSP camera's admin password in plaintext,
# plus the station hostname and an internal camera IP list. Nothing in this
# repo reads it - it is written by tooling outside this codebase - so it has
# no business being tracked. Ignored rather than merely untracked because
# `git add .` will happily re-stage an untracked file, which is how it got
# committed in dc6f917 in the first place.
/config.json
